; Like beancount's validate_currency_constraints, the constraint is the last
; open's that names currencies: a later open naming none leaves it, and it
; applies to a posting made before the account opens.
2019-01-01 open Assets:Bank

2019-02-01 * "before the open"
  Assets:Bank     1000.00 CAD
  Income:Salary  -1000.00 CAD

2019-03-01 open Income:Salary USD
2019-03-02 open Income:Salary

2019-04-01 * "after both opens"
  Assets:Bank     1000.00 CAD
  Income:Salary  -1000.00 CAD
